    "reviews": "\u201cIt has all the best elements of modern Zelda classics while retaining a personal identity...\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Bonus Stage<br><br>\u201c...Legends of Ethernal is reminiscent of classic adventure games of days past.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Common Sense Media<br><br>\u201cIf you enjoy 2D puzzle platforming games with metroidvania elements then Legends of Ethernal might just suck you in with its great gameplay, characters, world and mysterious story.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 The Indie Gaming Guild<br>",
